message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper below."
title: "esdd2-pooling-audit: reproduction code for metric identifiability under structural-zero pooling"
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Shakhoyat/esdd2-pooling-audit"
abstract: >-
  Recomputes every numeric claim in "Metric Identifiability Under
  Structural-Zero Pooling in Audio Anti-Spoofing" from per-clip scores,
  without reading any cached result.
